#==================== 全局 HTTPDNS 防泄露 (核心修复) ====================
# 强制所有 App 降级使用系统 DNS，防止直连 IP 穿透分流规则
DOMAIN,httpdns.xiaohongshu.com,REJECT
DOMAIN,httpdns.alidns.com,REJECT
DOMAIN,httpdns.aliyuncs.com,REJECT
DOMAIN,httpdns.douyin.com,REJECT
DOMAIN,httpdns.snssdk.com,REJECT
DOMAIN,httpdns.volcengineapi.com,REJECT
DOMAIN,httpdns.biliapi.net,REJECT
DOMAIN,httpdns.baidu.com,REJECT
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,bilihttpdns.biliapi.net,REJECT
DOMAIN-KEYWORD,httpdns.c.byte,REJECT

#==================== 小红书 (彻底修复 IP 泄露) ====================
# 1. 拦截测速和性能监控（这些最容易偷偷上报真实 IP）
DOMAIN,xy.xiaohongshu.com,REJECT 
DOMAIN,apm.xiaohongshu.com,REJECT 
DOMAIN,apm.xhscdn.com,REJECT
DOMAIN,referee.xiaohongshu.com,REJECT

# 2. CDN 流媒体优先直连 (改为精确 DOMAIN 或 KEYWORD，防止误伤 API)
DOMAIN,ci.xiaohongshu.com,DIRECT
DOMAIN,img.xiaohongshu.com,DIRECT
DOMAIN,v.xiaohongshu.com,DIRECT
DOMAIN,media.xiaohongshu.com,DIRECT
DOMAIN,static.xiaohongshu.com,DIRECT
DOMAIN-KEYWORD,sns-img-,DIRECT
DOMAIN-KEYWORD,sns-video-,DIRECT

# 3. 核心发帖/评论 API (强制代理隐藏 IP)
DOMAIN,edith.xiaohongshu.com,DomesticSocial # 发帖评论最核心 API
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,api.xiaohongshu.com,DomesticSocial
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,api-hybrid.xiaohongshu.com,DomesticSocial
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,api-sns.xiaohongshu.com,DomesticSocial
