DOMAIN-SUFFIX,log.xiaohongshu.com,DomesticSocial
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,verify.xiaohongshu.com,DomesticSocial
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,grpc.xiaohongshu.com,DomesticSocial

# 4. 广义主域兜底（确保未知新接口全部代理）
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,xiaohongshu.com,DomesticSocial
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,xiaohongshu.net,DomesticSocial
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,xiaohongshunew.com,DomesticSocial
